WEBVTT

01:58.520 --> 01:59.840
Good morning, everyone.

01:59.920 --> 02:01.360
I'm back to work.

02:35.000 --> 02:37.480
This… This is…

02:40.800 --> 02:43.240
The online launch of the Red Mist
Air Cushion was successful.

02:43.320 --> 02:44.640
It's all thanks to you.

02:45.880 --> 02:48.360
I just wrote a proposal
for the product developer.

02:48.440 --> 02:49.760
It was Yi who pushed it forward.

02:49.840 --> 02:51.240
Everyone worked together.

02:51.320 --> 02:52.280
Everyone contributed.

02:52.360 --> 02:55.320
Mr. Zhou said our department's
project bonus will double.

02:57.920 --> 03:01.160
- Thank you, Mr. Gu.
- Thank you, Mr. Gu, Mr. Zhou.

03:03.040 --> 03:05.440
Su Chengcheng, this proposal is great.

03:05.520 --> 03:08.160
You'll be the best employee of the year.

03:08.240 --> 03:09.840
You have to treat us to a big meal then.

03:09.920 --> 03:11.080
Of course.

03:11.160 --> 03:12.400
You're awesome!

03:13.400 --> 03:15.360
Let's get to work.

03:30.080 --> 03:30.920
Chengcheng.

03:34.080 --> 03:35.640
Flowers from Tang Qi?

03:40.160 --> 03:42.160
Xu Yue, your flowers.

03:42.240 --> 03:43.080
Thank you.

03:47.840 --> 03:49.920
Seems you don't know anything.

03:50.000 --> 03:51.120
You don't have flowers on Monday.

03:51.200 --> 03:53.960
Lin said Mr. Tang thought
it was not going to work.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.720
Looks like Mr. Tang
finally knows your true colors.

04:04.520 --> 04:06.840
Fang Jin just finalized
the divorce on Monday,

04:06.920 --> 04:08.800
and Tang Qi immediately
canceled the order.

04:08.880 --> 04:11.400
He really couldn't wait.
He won't waste a single penny.

04:14.560 --> 04:15.880
Wait.

04:16.600 --> 04:18.160
I was paying for the flowers.

04:24.520 --> 04:26.520
You canceled the flower order early.

04:26.600 --> 04:27.680
Where's the refund?

04:28.920 --> 04:30.600
TANG QI

04:32.240 --> 04:33.080
Dr. Fang.

04:33.160 --> 04:35.920
This weekend,
I'd like to talk to you face to face.

04:38.840 --> 04:41.200
I forgot to take out the SIM card.

04:41.800 --> 04:42.880
I don't have time.

04:53.440 --> 04:56.000
You haven't replied to my question.

04:56.080 --> 04:59.480
No matter what,
avoiding it isn't a solution.

04:59.560 --> 05:01.080
We have to face it.

05:01.160 --> 05:02.440
When do you have time?

05:02.520 --> 05:03.840
I can go see you anytime.

05:08.560 --> 05:10.240
How long has Su Miao been dead?

05:10.320 --> 05:12.720
And you've already fallen for Fang Jin,
clinging to her?

05:12.800 --> 05:14.400
Do you think that's normal?

05:24.080 --> 05:27.320
Calm down. Calm down.

05:39.480 --> 05:42.560
Why does Tang Qi keep bothering Fang Jin?

05:44.360 --> 05:46.120
Because he likes Fang Jin.

05:48.400 --> 05:50.720
As long as he stops liking Fang Jin,

05:50.800 --> 05:52.440
however strange Fang Jin acts,

05:52.520 --> 05:54.000
he has no right to interfere.

06:01.640 --> 06:03.080
ORIGINAL IMAGE, SEND

06:12.080 --> 06:13.280
FANG JIN: ???

06:18.760 --> 06:21.480
Fang Jin, Tang Qi is a bit stubborn.

06:21.560 --> 06:23.840
I'm afraid he'll chase you
to your company and lab.

06:23.920 --> 06:25.680
We need to solve this completely.

06:30.720 --> 06:32.760
OK, I'll follow your lead.

06:39.680 --> 06:40.720
TANG QI

06:43.680 --> 06:45.520
OK. See you this weekend.

06:50.280 --> 06:52.560
Thanks. Looking forward to meeting you.

07:01.440 --> 07:04.240
It'll be refunded a week later.

07:08.760 --> 07:09.880
What a jerk.

07:14.760 --> 07:17.120
Yes, I want to make an appointment
with a psychiatrist.

07:18.280 --> 07:19.280
It's my first time.

07:24.120 --> 07:25.840
I have no history of mental illness

07:27.440 --> 07:29.000
or violent tendencies.

07:33.360 --> 07:37.200
I recently suffered
a major emotional trauma.

07:39.840 --> 07:41.840
OK.

07:43.520 --> 07:44.360
Thank you.

07:45.840 --> 07:47.400
Alright, I'll be there on time.

07:55.520 --> 07:56.960
I recognize every word,

07:57.040 --> 08:00.040
but when they're in a sentence,
I have no idea what it's saying.

08:06.080 --> 08:07.880
Is it serious enough
to see a psychologist?

08:09.960 --> 08:12.760
How would you explain
that I saw two Fang Jin?

08:18.560 --> 08:19.680
Apart from science,

08:20.680 --> 08:23.400
I can't think of any other way
to explain the problem I'm facing.

08:25.280 --> 08:27.440
It'll be helpful to consult
with a psychologist.

08:27.520 --> 08:29.800
If you need any help,
feel free to call me.

08:33.840 --> 08:35.120
Are you free this weekend?

08:47.360 --> 08:49.600
Fang Jin asked you to meet her
at the tennis court.

08:49.680 --> 08:53.400
Isn't this a perfect chance
to show off your strengths?

08:57.120 --> 08:58.440
Face it with your tiger's mouth.

08:58.520 --> 08:59.640
- Here, grip lower.
- Grip lower. Good.

08:59.720 --> 09:02.040
Then pull back.

09:02.120 --> 09:04.040
Point with your left hand.
With my left hand…

09:04.120 --> 09:05.600
- Relax your waist.
- Relax…

09:05.680 --> 09:08.560
- Lock it in. Use your legs.
- Sure.

09:19.640 --> 09:22.480
Strength shows in competitions.

09:23.080 --> 09:24.280
Dr. Fang.

09:25.720 --> 09:26.680
You're here.

09:27.440 --> 09:30.040
Just in time. We can play doubles.

09:37.120 --> 09:39.600
Tang and I against you two?

09:41.000 --> 09:42.880
- Yes.
- Now?

09:44.400 --> 09:45.440
Now.

10:06.720 --> 10:08.800
Take it easy. Have mercy on the young man.

10:33.960 --> 10:35.080
Come on.

10:35.680 --> 10:36.720
Come on.

10:43.640 --> 10:44.720
Yeah!

10:50.920 --> 10:51.760
Again.

11:10.640 --> 11:11.680
Again.

11:19.640 --> 11:21.280
Again.

11:23.800 --> 11:24.960
Again.

11:37.640 --> 11:39.920
You're amazing. You're so awesome.

11:40.000 --> 11:41.400
- Amazing, right?
- You're awesome.

11:44.040 --> 11:45.000
Take a break.

12:06.880 --> 12:09.240
Sit down. Are you tired?

12:23.360 --> 12:25.480
Was I being too fake just now?

12:26.440 --> 12:27.320
Not at all.

12:27.840 --> 12:30.040
People in love are always like this.

12:30.560 --> 12:31.760
Alright.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.480
Smile sweeter.

12:57.920 --> 12:59.000
Drink some water.

13:14.600 --> 13:16.760
- Is it working?
- Yes.

13:18.200 --> 13:19.040
Alright.

13:24.120 --> 13:25.400
Should I wipe your sweat for you?

13:51.440 --> 13:52.280
Again.

13:56.640 --> 13:58.400
This is the crucial moment.

13:58.480 --> 14:00.000
Applause and cheers should be louder.

14:00.080 --> 14:01.160
OK.

15:05.800 --> 15:08.560
Go, go, go!

16:07.880 --> 16:11.040
You played so well, so amazing.

16:11.640 --> 16:13.000
- You're amazing.
- Really?

16:13.080 --> 16:14.200
Incredible.

16:36.200 --> 16:38.320
Young men are flashy but lack depth.

16:38.400 --> 16:40.560
Your brain is much better than his.

16:42.880 --> 16:45.520
I was too focused on playing
to introduce you.

16:46.320 --> 16:48.200
This is Dr. Tang Qi.

16:48.280 --> 16:49.440
This is Gu Yu.

16:50.720 --> 16:51.960
He's my junior,

16:52.040 --> 16:54.280
a PhD in material science and engineering.

16:54.360 --> 16:57.200
He's fluent in English, French,
German, and Spanish.

16:59.720 --> 17:02.200
Hello. Nice to meet you.

17:02.280 --> 17:04.800
Hello. Nice to meet you.

17:04.880 --> 17:07.040
Hello. Nice to meet you.

17:07.119 --> 17:09.400
Hello. Nice to meet you.

17:09.480 --> 17:12.200
I'm Quan Shengtang. Quan, as in all.

17:12.280 --> 17:14.920
Sheng, as in victory.
Tang, as in the Tang dynasty.

17:16.240 --> 17:17.079
Quan Shengtang.

17:18.920 --> 17:19.880
What a coincidence.

17:23.440 --> 17:25.720
You forgot the most important thing.

17:29.760 --> 17:30.920
Quan is my boyfriend.

17:33.520 --> 17:34.440
This is my girlfriend.

17:44.720 --> 17:45.720
You two aren't suited for each other.

18:04.920 --> 18:06.760
Tang is joking.

18:06.840 --> 18:08.000
The joke's a bit cold.

18:08.080 --> 18:10.600
- What he means is…
- You don't know the real Fang Jin.

18:11.160 --> 18:12.720
You're not suited for each other.

18:14.000 --> 18:15.600
At least, not right now.

18:16.840 --> 18:19.200
Are you saying you know the real Fang Jin?

18:19.920 --> 18:21.240
I know her better than you do.

18:22.920 --> 18:23.880
Ridiculous.

18:25.360 --> 18:27.160
Does a playboy like you even know

18:27.760 --> 18:28.920
what it means to know someone?

18:31.920 --> 18:32.760
What did you say?

18:34.320 --> 18:35.240
Dr. Tang.

18:36.840 --> 18:38.480
You're not qualified to say that.

18:39.240 --> 18:41.120
Quan definitely knows me
better than you do.

18:42.400 --> 18:44.440
I know you like me,

18:44.520 --> 18:45.640
but sorry,

18:45.720 --> 18:47.120
I don't like you.

18:47.200 --> 18:48.760
I have a boyfriend now.

18:49.600 --> 18:50.760
You got it wrong.

18:51.680 --> 18:52.680
I don't like you.

18:59.040 --> 19:00.080
Dr. Fang.

19:03.000 --> 19:05.640
I need to talk with you alone.

19:08.680 --> 19:10.480
Can't we talk here?

19:10.560 --> 19:13.360
It's about privacy. We need to talk alone.

19:19.440 --> 19:20.360
OK.

19:22.720 --> 19:24.080
Everyone's sweating.

19:24.160 --> 19:26.400
Let's go wash up and change first.

19:26.480 --> 19:29.040
We'll meet outside the tennis court.

19:29.120 --> 19:30.440
We can talk slowly.

19:32.120 --> 19:33.000
OK.

19:41.320 --> 19:43.520
- How did I play?
- Great.

19:43.600 --> 19:44.680
Of course.

19:46.280 --> 19:47.760
I wish I could play that well.

19:55.400 --> 19:56.800
The men's changing room is here.

20:08.000 --> 20:09.840
The men's changing room is over there.

20:09.920 --> 20:11.800
Oh, right. It's over there.

20:19.080 --> 20:20.960
I'm meeting friends in the suburbs
this afternoon. Goodbye.

21:25.840 --> 21:26.720
What's wrong?

21:29.160 --> 21:30.120
I…

21:31.160 --> 21:33.200
I want to go to the bathroom.

21:34.200 --> 21:35.240
Go and turn left.

21:35.320 --> 21:36.520
Keep going, and you'll find the bathroom.

21:40.200 --> 21:41.280
You don't have to wait for me.

21:43.200 --> 21:44.640
I'm a bit constipated.

21:45.400 --> 21:47.080
You're meeting Fang Jin, remember?

21:48.080 --> 21:50.720
Don't mind me. Go to find Fang Jin.

21:53.640 --> 21:54.680
Remember to go.

22:31.640 --> 22:33.400
If you want to go to the bathroom,
turn left.

22:34.720 --> 22:35.680
I know.

22:53.080 --> 22:54.000
Tang Qi.

23:06.880 --> 23:08.840
What's wrong? Are you not feeling well?

23:12.360 --> 23:13.480
No, I'm fine.

23:14.720 --> 23:17.200
It's just happy to see you. It's thumping.

23:19.280 --> 23:21.720
Didn't you say you didn't like me?

23:24.720 --> 23:26.440
I don't like the Fang Jin
on the tennis court.

23:27.800 --> 23:29.400
What do you mean?

23:30.920 --> 23:32.000
There are two Fang Jin.

23:34.480 --> 23:35.520
The one I like,

23:37.120 --> 23:38.480
and the other one I don't like.

23:40.840 --> 23:42.240
I don't know what you're saying.

23:42.320 --> 23:43.840
Quan Shengtang is waiting for me.
I'm leaving.

23:45.880 --> 23:47.240
The first time I met you,

23:47.760 --> 23:49.600
you beat Guan Shengyu so badly.

23:49.680 --> 23:51.960
You don't seem to be a victim
of domestic violence.

23:53.520 --> 23:55.240
I just couldn't stand it anymore.

23:55.320 --> 23:57.000
Usually, I'm very calm and gentle.

23:58.520 --> 23:59.760
I've heard.

24:00.360 --> 24:03.240
Your research assistant said
you're calm and gentle

24:03.320 --> 24:04.520
and often avoid conflicts,

24:05.320 --> 24:06.960
but that night in the factory,

24:07.480 --> 24:09.160
you were decisive and resolute.

24:09.240 --> 24:11.360
You took down two security guards
by yourself.

24:12.800 --> 24:13.760
I…

24:14.680 --> 24:16.200
I practiced when I was young.
My assistant doesn't know.

24:16.280 --> 24:18.400
I confessed to you
that night under the rainbow.

24:20.320 --> 24:21.480
Ten minutes later,

24:22.880 --> 24:24.120
it seemed like you lost your memory

24:25.880 --> 24:27.000
and didn't know anything.

24:29.160 --> 24:32.480
I was pretending not to know. Actually…

24:32.560 --> 24:35.400
Stop making up stories to cover up.

24:38.360 --> 24:39.480
I know everything.

24:40.720 --> 24:44.200
You know everything? How did you find out?

24:44.280 --> 24:46.240
I've consulted with professionals.

24:48.040 --> 24:51.400
Your symptoms match
dissociative identity disorder.

24:54.760 --> 24:57.280
There are two personalities
of Fang Jin in your body.

24:57.840 --> 24:59.240
You know about the other Fang Jin,

24:59.320 --> 25:01.280
but the other Fang Jin
doesn't know about you.

25:05.280 --> 25:06.160
Are you saying

25:07.320 --> 25:09.720
- I'm sick?
- It's okay.

25:09.800 --> 25:13.520
You've just suffered
long-term mental and physical abuse,

25:14.320 --> 25:15.440
so you're mentally sick.

25:21.200 --> 25:23.760
Yes, I have that disorder.

25:23.840 --> 25:25.760
That's right. DID.

25:25.840 --> 25:29.760
Don't be afraid. I'll face it with you.

25:47.480 --> 25:50.200
Tang Qi thinks Fang Jin has DID?

25:52.000 --> 25:54.000
Tang insists there are two Fang Jin.

25:54.080 --> 25:55.920
If it's not Tang who has issues,

25:56.000 --> 25:57.920
then it's Fang Jin.

25:58.000 --> 25:59.440
That's the only scientific explanation.

26:01.000 --> 26:02.240
If he reads a little less,

26:02.320 --> 26:04.080
he wouldn't think
of such a scientific explanation.

26:04.160 --> 26:05.400
Not sure if he's a genius or a fool.

26:06.800 --> 26:08.600
So, you're saying Tang is wrong?

26:09.480 --> 26:10.920
No, no.

26:11.000 --> 26:12.240
I'm not saying anything.

26:12.320 --> 26:13.960
Let's think about what to do with chicken.

26:17.840 --> 26:21.200
If we're making soup,
go for a hen over a year old.

26:21.280 --> 26:23.640
For stir-fry, choose a younger hen.

26:23.720 --> 26:24.760
Soup, then.

26:31.240 --> 26:34.000
That rooster's been chasing
the spotted hen all day,

26:34.080 --> 26:35.600
and now it's cozying up to the black hen.

26:35.680 --> 26:37.640
He's just like Tang Qi,
falling for anyone he sees.

26:42.160 --> 26:43.680
Tang Qi can't help it.

26:44.440 --> 26:47.280
Love isn't something you can control.

26:47.880 --> 26:50.840
Tell the chef to butcher that rooster,
chop it up, put it in hot oil,

26:50.920 --> 26:52.760
and stir-fry it with chili
and Sichuan pepper.

26:52.840 --> 26:54.720
We'll also have a dry pot rooster.

26:56.760 --> 27:00.480
Tang Qi and I are good friends,
but we're different.

27:00.560 --> 27:02.680
Don't get the wrong idea. We're different.

27:03.440 --> 27:05.040
Relax. We're besties.

27:05.120 --> 27:06.840
I'm always lenient with my besties.

27:11.360 --> 27:13.680
Buddies… We're buddies.

27:13.760 --> 27:15.600
I'm always lenient with my buddies.

27:17.000 --> 27:18.040
Good friends.

27:18.120 --> 27:19.600
Alright, good friends.

27:20.120 --> 27:22.520
That's enough.
Let's add tomato-egg stir-fry.

27:22.600 --> 27:24.360
We can take the rest home for breakfast.

27:26.240 --> 27:29.600
There's only one character missing
to be a good girlfriend.

27:54.440 --> 27:55.280
Alright, that's enough.

27:55.360 --> 27:56.240
Thanks.

28:06.880 --> 28:08.440
Tang Qi…

28:08.520 --> 28:10.600
If you call him devoted,

28:10.680 --> 28:12.560
he falls for everyone he meets.

28:12.640 --> 28:14.280
But if you call him a player,

28:14.960 --> 28:17.320
most guys would've run away by now.

28:17.400 --> 28:19.840
Yet he sticks around,

28:19.920 --> 28:21.640
acting all loyal and responsible.

28:23.840 --> 28:25.280
Tang Qi wants to face your…

28:26.560 --> 28:30.800
No. My DID with me?

28:36.120 --> 28:37.240
How's that even possible?

28:39.240 --> 28:40.680
We can't keep going like this.

28:41.480 --> 28:42.960
Of course not.

28:44.920 --> 28:45.760
I have an idea.

28:47.200 --> 28:50.320
There's a show called Kill Me, Heal Me.

28:50.400 --> 28:52.440
The male lead has seven personalities.

28:52.520 --> 28:56.560
The healing process
is basically each personality dying off

28:56.640 --> 28:59.480
until only the original remains,

28:59.560 --> 29:01.840
who then lives happily
with the female lead.

29:05.480 --> 29:06.480
I see.

29:06.560 --> 29:08.440
So, through healing,

29:08.520 --> 29:10.400
the Fang Jin I turned into will disappear.

29:11.960 --> 29:14.320
You get me.

29:21.960 --> 29:23.560
You've been receiving treatment all along?

29:24.120 --> 29:25.200
Yes.

29:25.800 --> 29:27.800
I wasn't planning to tell anyone,

29:27.880 --> 29:29.280
but since you found out,

29:29.360 --> 29:31.000
I might as well be honest.

29:31.760 --> 29:35.440
I exist because Fang Jin
suffered long-term abuse

29:35.520 --> 29:37.240
mentally and physically

29:37.320 --> 29:39.240
from Guan Shengyu in their marriage.

29:39.320 --> 29:43.680
To protect herself, she created me.

29:47.640 --> 29:49.120
Just as I suspected.

29:51.800 --> 29:53.280
You're really smart.

29:55.840 --> 29:57.000
You're smart too.

30:01.760 --> 30:04.920
The good news is the treatment is working.

30:05.000 --> 30:07.280
I appear less and less.

30:07.360 --> 30:10.080
The doctor says after one final treatment,

30:10.160 --> 30:11.800
I'll disappear completely.

30:17.520 --> 30:18.600
Disappear?

30:22.560 --> 30:23.520
What do you mean?

30:24.680 --> 30:28.200
I was created to protect Fang Jin.

30:28.800 --> 30:31.400
Now that she's divorced Guan Shengyu

30:31.480 --> 30:32.960
and living happily,

30:33.600 --> 30:35.080
I have to go.

30:40.760 --> 30:41.960
Does it have to be this way?

30:44.120 --> 30:46.240
The only reason I'm here

30:46.320 --> 30:48.200
is to protect Fang Jin.

30:49.000 --> 30:50.520
Now that she doesn't need me,

30:51.160 --> 30:54.400
she can only fully heal if I disappear.

30:54.960 --> 30:58.080
Today, I came to say goodbye.

31:17.440 --> 31:18.400
You once said

31:20.880 --> 31:21.920
rainbows are beautiful.

31:29.760 --> 31:31.200
I have one request.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.800
Before you go,

31:38.520 --> 31:39.960
I want to see a rainbow with you.

31:58.320 --> 31:59.800
A rainbow isn't guaranteed,

32:00.680 --> 32:02.640
even after rain.

32:35.600 --> 32:38.960
Didn't you say we're going
to see a rainbow?

32:40.640 --> 32:44.280
Just wait. I'll cast a little magic,
and you'll see a rainbow for sure.

32:44.360 --> 32:47.800
Alright, I'll wait for your magic.

33:05.400 --> 33:09.120
I remember you like beef tendons.

33:10.960 --> 33:13.040
My tastes are different
from the original me.

33:13.120 --> 33:14.280
That's normal.

33:16.960 --> 33:18.600
You and the other Fang Jin are different.

33:20.680 --> 33:22.000
You like apples too.

33:23.520 --> 33:25.840
I do. Why?

33:28.200 --> 33:31.440
You look really cute when you eat apples.

33:40.360 --> 33:41.440
You said

33:42.480 --> 33:45.760
the only reason you were here
was to protect Fang Jin.

33:47.000 --> 33:47.840
I disagree.

33:50.240 --> 33:51.360
Protecting Fang Jin

33:53.120 --> 33:55.000
isn't your only reason for being here.

33:56.360 --> 33:57.520
Then, what is?

34:00.120 --> 34:01.200
The first time I met you,

34:02.360 --> 34:03.760
I thought you were really brave.

34:05.280 --> 34:06.680
I'm brave?

34:07.920 --> 34:10.880
You're warm and thoughtful.

34:11.960 --> 34:13.920
You're giving me too much credit.

34:15.320 --> 34:16.800
You took care of me when I was hurt.

34:19.040 --> 34:20.679
I'm not as good as you think.

34:30.000 --> 34:31.000
You even saved me.

34:35.639 --> 34:37.159
That was just a coincidence.

34:48.400 --> 34:50.239
I've seen many rainbows,

34:51.639 --> 34:53.239
but the one you showed me

34:56.840 --> 34:57.840
was the most beautiful.

35:01.000 --> 35:03.440
You'll see even more beautiful ones.

35:12.360 --> 35:14.240
You love this world so gently

35:18.280 --> 35:19.640
that it becomes a better place
because of you.

35:24.280 --> 35:25.240
You once said

35:27.240 --> 35:28.680
a rainbow is beautiful

35:30.880 --> 35:32.200
simply because it is a rainbow.

35:36.320 --> 35:37.280
And you…

35:40.120 --> 35:41.600
You're the reason you're here.

35:54.360 --> 35:56.560
I'm not worth it. Don't say that.

36:03.680 --> 36:05.960
Alright. Magic time.

36:11.400 --> 36:12.720
Look where I'm pointing.

37:21.240 --> 37:22.960
You showed me a rainbow once.

37:27.200 --> 37:28.840
Now, I'm showing you one too.

37:36.720 --> 37:38.920
We just walked on a rainbow.

39:37.560 --> 39:38.400
Goodbye.

40:20.400 --> 40:21.240
Goodbye.
